---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Corporate Tax Planning & Advisory | Transaction Tax — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="Strategic corporate direct and indirect tax planning, transaction tax structuring, transfer pricing, and statutory revenue representation by Aakkam Corporate Solutions."
>

  <!-- Clean Light Header with Krasis Orange Accents -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-50/60 via-white to-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80 py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-orange-100/80 text-brand-orange border border-orange-200 mb-4">
        Fiscal Optimization
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Corporate Tax Planning
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Maximizing tax efficiency, structuring corporate transactions, and ensuring statutory compliance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          Corporate Tax Planning & Advisory
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          In a dynamic regulatory environment, forward-looking tax planning is an indispensable driver of enterprise value, shareholder returns, and capital preservation. Proactive fiscal structuring enables companies to optimize cash flow, eliminate double taxation, and maintain seamless compliance with fiscal authorities.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          Aakkam Corporate Solutions provides comprehensive direct and indirect tax advisory services. Our multidisciplinary team of corporate tax strategists, chartered accountants, and legal advisors works closely with corporate boards to engineer robust, compliant tax frameworks tailored to your operating model.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Our Core Tax Planning Solutions</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 pt-2">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50/40 border border-orange-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-100 text-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <Icons name="tax" class="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Transaction Tax Structuring</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Optimizing tax exposure during mergers, acquisitions, hive-offs, slump sales, demergers, and capital reorganizations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-orange-50/40 border border-orange-100">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-100 text-brand-orange flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <Icons name="diligence" class="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Corporate Direct Tax Planning</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Maximizing allowable exemptions, capital allowances, depreciation optimization, and R&D incentives under prevailing tax codes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 border border-slate-200">
              <Icons name="shield" class="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Indirect Taxation & GST Advisory</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Structuring supply chains, input tax credit (ITC) optimization, customs classifications, and GST compliance reviews.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 border border-slate-200">
              <Icons name="project" class="w-5 h-5" />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Transfer Pricing & Cross-Border Tax</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Benchmarking arm's-length international transactions, Double Taxation Avoidance Agreements (DTAA), and master file documentation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-brand-orange hover:bg-brand-orangeHover shadow-md shadow-orange-500/20 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <span>Schedule Tax Planning Advisory</span>
            <Icons name="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/917010311971?text=Hello%20Aakkam%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20corporate%20tax%20planning."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
          >
            <Icons name="whatsapp" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" />
            <span>Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/tax" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
